The power mean inequality states that for a sequence of non-negative real numbers and exponents \( r > s \): \[
\left( \frac{1}{n} \sum_{k=1}^{n} a_k^r \right)^{1/r} \geq \left( \frac{1}{n} \sum_{k=1}^{n} a_k^s \right)^{1/s}
\]
